      "content": "okay that sounds scary. but if i only take a small dose, like half a pill, would that still be a big risk? i really can't afford to miss more work. i'm thinking of just taking 25mg instead of the full 50mg just to be safe. would that basically eliminate the risk of that serotonin thing?",
